<div class="notice mt2"><strong>Disclosure:</strong> Lenders may pay Hard.Money a subscription or placement fee to be listed or featured; featured listings are paid placements and not recommendations. Inclusion is not an endorsement, exclusion is not a judgment, and we are compensated when you submit a funding request. Terms shown are indicative, compiled from public sources on October 30, 2026, and may have changed. Always verify licensing with your state regulator and <a href="https://www.nmlsconsumeraccess.org" rel="noopener" target="_blank">NMLS Consumer Access</a>.</div>
